          "Fingerprint": "sha256:28bcb38e95c1b90ac758b2e0dcbe958c1ce14262021bdb0bbaa955b02f33d5eb",
          "Title": "libcurl: libcurl: Use-after-free via curl_easy_pause() in CURLMOPT_SOCKETFUNCTION callback",
          "Description": "Calling `curl_easy_pause()` within the event-based `CURLMOPT_SOCKETFUNCTION`\ncallback triggers a use-after-free vulnerability, where libcurl attempts to\nstore a flag using a dangling struct pointer immediately after that pointer's\nmemory has been freed.",
