          "Title": "curl: curl: HSTS cache import drops longer-lived child",
          "Description": "Importing a `includeSubDomains` parent HSTS entry before a longer-lived child\nentry, silently drops the child. Consequently, when the parent expires, the\nchild's valid HSTS policy is lost, causing curl to issue unencrypted HTTP\nrequests rather than upgrading to HTTPS.",
